<section class="band heavy"><div class="wrap heavy-in">
 <div><p class="eyebrow">Deep and heavy duty cleans</p><h2>The dirtier the job, the more we enjoy it</h2></div>
 <div class="heavy-txt"><p>A lot of people put off calling a cleaner because they are embarrassed. The oven has not been touched in years, the bathroom got away from them, or a tenant left a mess behind. We will not think anything, except where to start.</p>
 <p>Heavy duty and deep cleans are where our team's experience shows most. No judgement, no comments. Tell us what the place is like, or send us photos, and we send the right people for the job.</p>
 <a class="btn" href="/deep-house-cleaning/">See deep cleaning</a></div>
</div></section>
