 <div class="head"><p class="eyebrow">What you can expect</p><h2>You see the photos, not just our word</h2><p>Our cleaners photograph the property before they start and again when they finish. We send you a private link, so you can check every room from your phone, even if you have already handed the keys back.</p></div>
 <div class="expect">
  <ol class="steps">
   <li><b>Book and get your price.</b> Tell us the size of the home and the type of clean.</li>
   <li><b>Our own team arrives.</b> Trained, insured and DBS checked, with professional products.</li>
   <li><b>Before photos.</b> Every room, appliance and problem spot, taken as they start.</li>
   <li><b>After photos.</b> The same spots once they finish, in a separate folder.</li>
   <li><b>Your private link.</b> Before and after folders, ready to forward to your letting agent or landlord.</li>
   <li><b>Re clean if needed.</b> 7 days for end of tenancy and empty property after builders cleans, 24 hours for homes that are lived in.</li>
  </ol>
